  "answer_markdown": "After creating a Skill in Mistral AI Studio, you should verify the following in the **Verify** step to confirm it is ready for use:\n\n1. The Skill **appears in the Skills list** [1].\n2. The **description clearly explains when the Skill applies**, ensuring it is specific and not vague [1].\n3. The **output follows the procedure, format, and constraints** you defined in the instructions [1].\n4. Any **attached files are relevant and referenced** in the instructions [1].\n5. The **visibility is set correctly** (private to you or shared with the workspace) [1].\n6. The Skill is **published to Vibe** if you intend to use it in Vibe Work [1].\n7. The **version history** shows the original and updated versions (if applicable) [1].\n\nAdditionally, ensure:\n- The Skill **appears in the Skills view** under the correct scope (Personal or Workspace) [3].\n- Work **activates it automatically** on matching tasks, as indicated in the todos [3].\n- The output **consistently follows your format, tone, and constraints** across different inputs [3].",
