message.content:
{
  "answer_markdown": "To create a Workspace API key by calling `POST /v1/admin/api-keys`, the following fields in the request body are **required** according to the documentation [1]:\n\n- `workspace_uuid` (string, UUID format) — The Workspace ID for the API key.\n- `user_id` (string, UUID format) — The ID of the user the API key is created for.\n\nThe fields `name` and `expiration` are optional.\n\n**Example request body structure:**\n```json\n{\n  \"workspace_uuid\": \"<WORKSPACE_UUID>\",\n  \"user_id\": \"<USER_UUID>\",\n  \"name\": \"Optional API Key Name\",\n  \"expiration\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n}\n```",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "workspace_uuid (string (uuid), required) — Workspace ID for the API key."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "user_id (string (uuid), required) — ID of the user the API key is created for."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "name (string or null, optional) — Optional name for the API key."
    },
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "expiration (string (date) or null, optional) — Date when the API key should expire."
    }
  ],
  "insufficient_evidence": false
}

